From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 00:02:35 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Allow 90 minutes for the soil fetch

The tile search for 55 cities took about 34 minutes, longer than the previous 30-minute limit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012HbcbvEafNFn6aR2BmUheY
---
 dags/planting_pipeline.py | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dags/planting_pipeline.py b/dags/planting_pipeline.py
index 2f01e4d..818f298 100644
--- a/dags/planting_pipeline.py
+++ b/dags/planting_pipeline.py
@@ -82,7 +82,8 @@ with DAG(
     task_soil = PythonOperator(
         task_id="fetch_soil",
         python_callable=run_fetch_soil,
-        execution_timeout=timedelta(minutes=30),
+        # The tile search takes ~35 minutes for 55 cities; 30 minutes would cut the last cities off.
+        execution_timeout=timedelta(minutes=90),
     )
 
     task_weather = PythonOperator(
